> {
>   "$schema": "https://opencode.ai/config.json",
>   "provider": {
>     "nvidia": {
>       "options": {
>         "baseURL": "https://integrate.api.nvidia.com/v1",
>         "apiKey": "YOUR_NVIDIA_API_KEY"
>       },
>       "models": {
>         "minimaxai/minimax-m3": {
>           "name": "MiniMax-M3"
>         }
>       }
>     }
>   }
> }
> 
> 3. Get your NVIDIA API key from: https://ngc.nvidia.com/setup/api-key
> 4. Replace YOUR_NVIDIA_API_KEY in the config with your actual key
> 5. Restart opencode — that's it!
> ```

